%% Diagram 6 — Sanitized Power Automate cutover sequence
%% §2 must complete before any Cloudflare secret is written.

sequenceDiagram
  participant OP as Operator
  participant PA as Power Automate
  participant VAULT as Approved vault
  participant CF as Cloudflare

  OP->>PA: §2.1 Regenerate mapped triggers
  OP->>PA: §2.2 Delete and rebuild OTP/FETCH_ALL flows
  OP->>PA: §2.3 Delete unused triggers
  OP->>PA: §2.5 Build intake flows if missing
  PA-->>OP: New trigger URLs observed
  OP->>VAULT: Store full URLs outside Git
  Note over OP,CF: STOP — do not write any Cloudflare secret until all §2 records are complete
  OP->>CF: Write endpoint secrets from vault references only after §2 completion
  OP->>CF: Write DGO_UPLOAD_SECRET and DGO_VERIFY_SECRET
  OP->>CF: Deploy Worker / Pages per §§4–5
